Dialogue: 0,0:00:02.10,0:00:03.72,Note,0,0,0,0,,（忆往昔）
Dialogue: 0,0:00:03.80,0:00:04.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,你好 迪恩\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hi, Dean.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:04.83,0:00:06.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,盖思\N{\fnArial\fs30}Garth.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:06.48,0:00:08.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,马默杜克 真够疯狂的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, Marmaduke, you're crazy!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:08.74,0:00:09.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,对他的好感是慢热型的\N{\fnArial\fs30}He grows on you.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:13.99,0:00:15.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,我都错过什么了\N{\fnArial\fs30}What'd I miss?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:15.16,0:00:16.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,你说得对 确实是慢热型的\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're right. He has grown on me.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:16.54,0:00:19.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,那是人家跟我说的最中听的一句话了\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's the nicest thing anyone's ever said to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:19.56,0:00:21.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不做猎人了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't hunt anymore.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:21.06,0:00:22.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你退出了 - 是的\N{\fnArial\fs30}- You quit? - Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:22.14,0:00:24.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,是什么让你就那么退出了\N{\fnArial\fs30}What could possibly make you stop just like that?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:24.92,0:00:26.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,是因为女孩吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Was there a girl?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:26.03,0:00:28.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,是 艾米利亚\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah. Amelia.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:28.03,0:00:29.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 好吧 你呢 - 我怎么了\N{\fnArial\fs30}- All right, what about you? - What about me?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:37.11,0:00:38.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,我叫本尼\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm Benny.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:44.72,0:00:47.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,看得出来你们两个有很多话要说\N{\fnArial\fs30}I can see you two have a lot to talk about.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:47.70,0:00:49.32,Note,0,0,0,0,,（如今）
Dialogue: 0,0:00:50.87,0:00:54.32,Note,0,0,0,0,,（密苏里州 科尔尼）
Dialogue: 0,0:01:16.11,0:01:17.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,亲爱的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, hon.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:17.29,0:01:18.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,来得正好\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just in time.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:19.28,0:01:20.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,给我拿杯冷饮 行吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Grab me a cold one, would ya?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:20.84,0:01:23.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,怎么不叫莎拉·奥尔科特给你拿\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why don't you have Sara Alcott get it for you?!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:24.71,0:01:25.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}What?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:27.97,0:01:30.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,天呐\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, my god!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:30.55,0:01:31.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,玛丽 救救我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mary, help!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:31.90,0:01:34.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,玛丽 你在干什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mary, what are you doing?!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:34.11,0:01:35.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,玛丽 你在干什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mary, what are you doing?!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:35.88,0:01:37.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,玛丽 玛丽 救救我 把…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mary! Mary, help me! Get the …
Dialogue: 0,0:01:37.49,0:01:38.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,玛丽\N{\fnArial\fs30}Aah! Mary!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:38.57,0:01:41.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,玛丽 不要\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mary! No!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:46.86,0:01:52.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,[邪恶力量 第8季第6集]
Dialogue: 0,0:01:55.40,0:01:56.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,喂喂\N{\fnArial\fs30}Heads up.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:57.26,0:01:59.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,我在警用扫描仪上听到了一桩案子\N{\fnArial\fs30}I caught wind of a case on this police scanner.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:59.56,0:02:00.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,听着像是我们的活儿\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sounds like our kind of thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:03.16,0:02:05.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,我离开还不到十分钟\N{\fnArial\fs30}I wasn't even gone 10 minutes.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:05.30,0:02:07.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧 那怎么了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay. That matters why?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:07.78,0:02:08.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不知道 迪恩\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't know, Dean.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:08.75,0:02:11.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,比如 从普兰提斯岛回来你就没跟我说过话\N{\fnArial\fs30}How about because you haven't said a word to me since Prentiss Island?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:11.44,0:02:13.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,怎么着 你就指望我坐在副驾 不说话\N{\fnArial\fs30}And now, what? You want me to shut up and ride shotgun.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:13.81,0:02:15.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,当什么事都没发生过吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}and act like nothing happened?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:16.48,0:02:17.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,你想谈本尼的事吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You want to talk about Benny?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:18.32,0:02:20.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 行 那就说呗 - 好啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Fine. Let's talk. - Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:21.16,0:02:23.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,不如说说他是个吸血鬼\N{\fnArial\fs30}How about he's a vampire?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:23.64,0:02:25.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,多亏了他我才站在这儿\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's also the reason I'm topside.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:25.14,0:02:27.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,而不是在炼狱里做烤肉\N{\fnArial\fs30}and not roasting on a spit in purgatory.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:27.04,0:02:27.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,还想听什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}Anything else?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:27.77,0:02:29.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,别弄得像我不理解你\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't pretend I don't get it.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:29.07,0:02:31.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,我知道你在下面身不由己\N{\fnArial\fs30}I know you had to do what you had to down there.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:31.13,0:02:32.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,我十分怀疑你理解炼狱的任何事\N{\fnArial\fs30}I highly doubt you get anything about purgatory.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:32.94,0:02:35.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,但你已经出来了 本尼却还活着\N{\fnArial\fs30}But you're out now, and Benny's still breathing.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:35.93,0:02:37.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,为什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:39.25,0:02:40.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,他是我的朋友 萨姆\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's my friend, Sam.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:43.65,0:02:46.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,那我的朋友艾米呢 她又怎么了\N{\fnArial\fs30}And what about my friend, Amy? She was what?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:46.31,0:02:48.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,你杀她的时候可毫不含糊\N{\fnArial\fs30}'cause you sure as hell didn't have a problem ganking her.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:48.95,0:02:50.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,人总是会变的 不是吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, I guess people change, don't they?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:50.95,0:02:53.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们还把狼人凯特放走了\N{\fnArial\fs30}We let that werewolf Kate go, didn't we?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:53.16,0:02:54.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,因为她不一样 她…\N{\fnArial\fs30}She was different. She …
Dialogue: 0,0:02:54.95,0:02:56.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,你觉得本尼也不一样\N{\fnArial\fs30}You think Benny's different?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:57.87,0:02:59.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,他是不是说他不直接吸人血什么的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Did he tell you he's not drinking live blood or something?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:03.43,0:03:05.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,你居然相信他\N{\fnArial\fs30}And you believe him.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:06.08,0:03:09.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,行 你说得对 人是会变\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay. You know, you're right. People do change.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:09.18,0:03:10.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,没错 我找了个吸血鬼兄弟\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah. I got a vampire buddy,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:10.44,0:03:13.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,而你把电话关了一年\N{\fnArial\fs30}and you turn your phone off for a year.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:13.39,0:03:14.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,别扯到我身上\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't turn this on me.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:15.82,0:03:17.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,听着 如果本尼犯错了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look, Benny slips up.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:17.03,0:03:21.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,其他猎人干掉了他 那就这样了\N{\fnArial\fs30}and some other hunter turns his lights out, so be it.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:21.69,0:03:23.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,但绝不会是你 对吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}But it's not gonna be you, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:27.54,0:03:29.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,你去不去\N{\fnArial\fs30}You coming or not?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:43.30,0:03:45.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,这家伙正在车底下捣鼓\N{\fnArial\fs30}So, guy's old lady comes home.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:45.15,0:03:46.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,他老婆回到家里\N{\fnArial\fs30}while he's working underneath his ride,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:46.74,0:03:49.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,一脚油门踩到底 削掉了他半个脑袋\N{\fnArial\fs30}puts the pedal to the metal, and takes half his head off.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:49.56,0:03:50.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,就这样吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}What, that's it?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:51.14,0:03:52.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,简而言之就是这样\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, in a nutshell.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:52.07,0:03:54.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,她说她昏过去了 什么都不记得了\N{\fnArial\fs30}She says she blacked out, doesn't remember a damn thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:54.71,0:03:56.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,听起来像是疯了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, sounds like insanity.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:56.30,0:03:57.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,可能吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Maybe.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:57.44,0:03:59.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,你为什么觉得这是我们的事\N{\fnArial\fs30}So, how does that make this our kind of thing?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:01.27,0:04:04.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,萨姆 因为凯文不见了 行吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Because, Sam, Kevin's in the wind, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:04.03,0:04:06.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,你就像个逛窑子的太监 闷闷不乐\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're sulking around like a eunuch in a whorehouse,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:06.60,0:04:08.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,我忍不住问自己\N{\fnArial\fs30}and I can't help but ask myself,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:08.10,0:04:10.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,削脑袋什么时候不是我的事了\N{\fnArial\fs30}when is decapitation not my thing?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:18.51,0:04:19.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,联调局\N{\fnArial\fs30}FBI?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:19.68,0:04:22.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,是啊 我们恰好就在附近\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, happened to be in the neighborhood.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:22.34,0:04:24.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,先是来了个德州骑警 现在又是你们\N{\fnArial\fs30}First a Texas ranger, now you guys?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:24.36,0:04:25.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,德州骑警\N{\fnArial\fs30}Texas ranger?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:25.61,0:04:28.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,对啊 先生 就在那边\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes, sir. Right over there.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:32.34,0:04:34.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,逗我玩儿呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, you got to be kidding me.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:45.04,0:04:46.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,好啊 查克·诺里斯\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, Chuck Norris.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:48.21,0:04:50.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,萨姆 迪恩\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sam? Dean!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:52.95,0:04:54.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,忘了他多爱抱人了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Forgot he was a hugger.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:54.18,0:04:55.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 过来抱抱 - 好吧 行啦\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Come here! - All right. Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:56.80,0:04:58.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们在处理公务呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're still … we're still working here.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:58.65,0:05:01.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们都不知道我有多想你们\N{\fnArial\fs30}Uh, you guys have no idea how much I missed you.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:01.64,0:05:03.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,让我们单独待会儿 好吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Um, excuse us, would you?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:03.16,0:05:04.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,是 我们就过来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, we'll be right back.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:07.55,0:05:09.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,德州骑警 盖思 你搞笑呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}A Texas ranger, Garth? Seriously?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:09.57,0:05:10.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,这可是密苏里\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're in Missouri.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:10.32,0:05:11.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,怎么了\N{\fnArial\fs30}What?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:11.51,0:05:13.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,拜托 我穿着西装就像丧葬承办人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on. I look like a funeral director in one of those.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:16.13,0:05:18.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,先前我听人说你们重出江湖了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I heard some chatter you two were back in the batter's box,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:18.39,0:05:20.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,我还不信 现在我信了\N{\fnArial\fs30}but I didn't believe it till now.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:20.80,0:05:24.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,稍等\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, uh, one sec.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:27.80,0:05:29.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,厄尔 有什么情况\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yo, Earl. What you got?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:30.41,0:05:31.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,一个幽灵\N{\fnArial\fs30}A revenant.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:31.71,0:05:34.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧 你准备一口棺材和几根银钉\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay, uh, you'll need a casket and some silver spikes.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:34.74,0:05:36.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,还有 别被咬到了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, and don't get bit.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:37.11,0:05:39.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,不会害你变异 但会疼死你\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, it won't turn you, but it will hurt like hell.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:39.73,0:05:40.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,都找到后\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay, so, once you got all that,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:40.97,0:05:44.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,把那东西钉在棺材里 埋结实了\N{\fnArial\fs30}nail that sucker in, bury him, and throw away the key.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:44.06,0:05:45.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,知道了吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:45.20,0:05:46.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,就这样 再见\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right. Hasta.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:47.54,0:05:48.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,你在干什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}What are you doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:49.74,0:05:51.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,我的工作啊 伙计\N{\fnArial\fs30}My job, hombre.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:51.05,0:05:52.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你的工作 - 是啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Your "Job"? - Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:52.32,0:05:54.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,你什么时候干起咨询来了\N{\fnArial\fs30}And since when is giving advice your job?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:54.75,0:05:57.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,等等 你就是那个新鲍比吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hold up. Are you the new Bobby?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:57.38,0:05:58.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,给我闭嘴\N{\fnArial\fs30}You shut your mouth.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:59.28,0:05:59.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,是啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:59.90,0:06:01.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,你也闭嘴\N{\fnArial\fs30}You shut your mouth.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:03.43,0:06:04.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,真的\N{\fnArial\fs30}What?!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:04.75,0:06:06.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,鲍比没了 你们俩都失踪了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Bobby was gone. You two were M.I.A.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:06.61,0:06:08.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,那段时间很古怪的\N{\fnArial\fs30}It was a weird time.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:09.13,0:06:11.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,总得有人来接手\N{\fnArial\fs30}Somebody had to step in and take up the slack.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:13.97,0:06:14.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,好了\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:14.85,0:06:15.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们还是继续工作\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let's just get back to work,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:15.96,0:06:17.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,过后再来谈这个事情 好吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}and we'll talk about this later, all right?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:19.87,0:06:21.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,盖思刚刚是在指挥我们吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Did Garth just tell us what to do?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:23.13,0:06:25.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,斯科特·卢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Uh, Scott Lew.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:25.55,0:06:26.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,这两位先生是联调局的人\N{\fnArial\fs30}These gentlemen here are with the FBI.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:26.82,0:06:29.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,卢先生的父母就是这件…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mr. Lew's parents were the individuals involved in this…
Dialogue: 0,0:06:29.69,0:06:31.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,不幸事件的当事人\N{\fnArial\fs30}unfortunate situation.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:31.17,0:06:32.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,节哀顺变\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sorry for your loss.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:32.42,0:06:33.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,有几个问题 卢先生\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just a few questions, Mr. Lew.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:35.17,0:06:38.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,你父母会不会 感情出现了什么问题\N{\fnArial\fs30}Um, by any chance were your parents having… marital problems?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:38.38,0:06:41.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,没有 至多就是些小磕绊\N{\fnArial\fs30}No. Uh, no more than anyone else.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:41.30,0:06:42.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,你母亲的健康状况如何\N{\fnArial\fs30}What about your mother's health?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:42.64,0:06:44.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,这会不会是癫痫 中风发作\N{\fnArial\fs30}Any chance this was a seizure, a stroke,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:44.48,0:06:46.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,有什么说得通的解释吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}anything that might help explain this?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:46.60,0:06:47.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,我想没有\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't think so.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:47.79,0:06:50.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们正在医院给她做检查\N{\fnArial\fs30}Um, they're checking her out at the, um, hospital right now.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:50.81,0:06:52.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,有什么古怪的表现吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}What about stranger behavior?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:52.37,0:06:54.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,古怪 譬如说\N{\fnArial\fs30}Stranger? How?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:54.32,0:06:55.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,听见幻声 看到幻象…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hearing voices, seeing things …
Dialogue: 0,0:06:55.71,0:06:57.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,你母亲提过这样的事情吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your mother mention anything like that?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:58.74,0:07:00.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,我父母结婚三十多年了\N{\fnArial\fs30}My parents were married for 30 years …
Dialogue: 0,0:07:00.91,0:07:02.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,高中时就是恋人\N{\fnArial\fs30}High-school sweethearts.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:02.03,0:07:04.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,不管你们怎么查\N{\fnArial\fs30}There's no good explanation for why this happened,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:04.69,0:07:06.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,这事根本解释不通\N{\fnArial\fs30}no matter where you want to look.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:07.81,0:07:10.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧 谢谢你 斯科特\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay, well, thank you, Scott.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:10.03,0:07:11.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,保持联系\N{\fnArial\fs30}We'll be in touch.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:23.96,0:07:25.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,没有电磁干扰\N{\fnArial\fs30}No EMF.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:25.89,0:07:27.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,没有硫磺的痕迹\N{\fnArial\fs30}No traces of sulfur anywhere.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:27.67,0:07:29.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,不出所料 白跑了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Like I thought … bust.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:30.93,0:07:32.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,别这么着急 萨姆\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hold on there, Sam.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:32.02,0:07:34.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,还有许多需要考虑的因素\N{\fnArial\fs30}There's a lot of things to factor in here.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:34.29,0:07:35.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,这事是昨晚发生的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Uh, it happened last night,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:35.77,0:07:37.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,读不到电磁干扰很正常\N{\fnArial\fs30}so the readings could be cold by now.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:37.44,0:07:38.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,说得对\N{\fnArial\fs30}Good point.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:38.44,0:07:40.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,再说了 即使有硫磺\N{\fnArial\fs30}And, uh, even if there was any sulfur,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:40.81,0:07:42.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,巴尼·法夫（搞笑电视剧中的副警长）和他的手下\N{\fnArial\fs30}Barney Fife and his crew.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:42.50,0:07:43.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,恐怕是把犯罪现场\N{\fnArial\fs30}probably contaminated the whole crime scene.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:43.85,0:07:46.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,以及所有证据都弄乱了\N{\fnArial\fs30}and any evidence that was here with it.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:46.05,0:07:48.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,他还真不赖\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wow. He's on a roll.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:48.03,0:07:49.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,可以这么说\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's one word for it.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:49.88,0:07:53.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,伙计们 我好像有发现\N{\fnArial\fs30}Uh, guys, I think I found something.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:56.18,0:07:58.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,那是口香糖还是灵质\N{\fnArial\fs30}Is that gum, or is that ectoplasm?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:58.32,0:08:00.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,灵质一般是黑的吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ectoplasm is usually black, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:05.57,0:08:07.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,绝对是灵质\N{\fnArial\fs30}Definitely ectoplasm.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:08.00,0:08:10.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,会是什么呢 应该是鬼魂吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}So, what are we thinking … uh, some kind of ghost, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:18.25,0:08:19.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,麦克雷骑警\N{\fnArial\fs30}Uh, Ranger McCrae here.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:19.54,0:08:21.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,要是哪只手机铃是锤子乐队的 我就砸了它\N{\fnArial\fs30}If one of those things rings Hammer, I'm throwing down.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:21.45,0:08:22.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,太好了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, great.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:23.57,0:08:24.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,好的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:27.52,0:08:28.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,好的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:30.88,0:08:32.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,谢了医生\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thanks, doc.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:33.23,0:08:34.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,我嘱咐过法医\N{\fnArial\fs30}Asked the coroner to drop me a line.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:34.38,0:08:37.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,尸检如果有什么不寻常就通知我\N{\fnArial\fs30}in case the autopsy turned up anything… unusual.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:37.64,0:08:38.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们猜怎么着\N{\fnArial\fs30}And guess what.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:39.16,0:08:43.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,死者胸口刻着一个词 「奥尔科特」\N{\fnArial\fs30}Our dead guy had the word "Alcott" carved into his chest.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:43.81,0:08:44.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,用什么刻的\N{\fnArial\fs30}With what?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:44.70,0:08:46.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,据法医猜测\N{\fnArial\fs30}Coroner's best guess?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:46.34,0:08:48.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,是他老婆玛丽的指甲\N{\fnArial\fs30}His wife Mary's fingernails.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:49.01,0:08:51.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,卢太太 能给我们讲讲发生了什么吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mrs. Lew, can you tell us what happened?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:52.48,0:08:55.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,我当时在商店买杂货\N{\fnArial\fs30}I was at the store getting groceries,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:55.51,0:08:57.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,等我再回过神来\N{\fnArial\fs30}and the next thing I know,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:57.24,0:09:00.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,我儿子斯科特发现我在车道上\N{\fnArial\fs30}my son Scott finds me in the driveway.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:02.99,0:09:04.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,切斯特已经…\N{\fnArial\fs30}And Chester was…
Dialogue: 0,0:09:08.51,0:09:10.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,你对发生的事有任何印象吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do you remember anything at all about what happened?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:12.81,0:09:14.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,切斯特的死\N{\fnArial\fs30}Um… Chester dying?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:16.08,0:09:17.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,不太记得\N{\fnArial\fs30}Not really.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:17.25,0:09:19.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,只有零星的记忆\N{\fnArial\fs30}Bits and pieces, I guess.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:27.54,0:09:28.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,比如呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Such as?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:29.72,0:09:32.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,我记得他的尖叫\N{\fnArial\fs30}I remember his screams…
Dialogue: 0,0:09:32.85,0:09:35.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,橡胶灼烧的味道\N{\fnArial\fs30}the smell of burnt rubber, and…
Dialogue: 0,0:09:36.49,0:09:39.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,我记得我非常愤怒\N{\fnArial\fs30}I remember feeling so angry …
Dialogue: 0,0:09:39.25,0:09:42.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,无法抑制的狂怒 我不能自控\N{\fnArial\fs30}just uncontrollable rage, like I wasn't myself.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:42.85,0:09:45.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,一切结束之后\N{\fnArial\fs30}And after it was over,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:46.48,0:09:47.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,那种愤怒\N{\fnArial\fs30}all that anger was …
Dialogue: 0,0:09:48.09,0:09:49.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,就消失了\N{\fnArial\fs30}It was gone.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:49.71,0:09:53.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,夫人 「奥尔科特」这个词你熟悉吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Uh, ma'am, does the word "Alcott" mean anything to you?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:58.28,0:10:00.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,她跟这件事有什么关系\N{\fnArial\fs30}What does she have to do with anything?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:00.98,0:10:02.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,是女的\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's a she?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:02.20,0:10:05.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,高中时我和我丈夫切斯特恋爱了好几年\N{\fnArial\fs30}My husband, Chester, and I were going steady in high school.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:05.19,0:10:07.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,感情本来很稳固 却突然大吵一架\N{\fnArial\fs30}for a few years already when we had a big fight.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:07.64,0:10:08.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,因为什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}What about?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:08.85,0:10:10.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,就是件蠢事\N{\fnArial\fs30}Something stupid, I'm sure.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:11.36,0:10:12.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,当时临近毕业舞会\N{\fnArial\fs30}It was around prom,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:12.61,0:10:16.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,他却抛弃我邀请了莎拉·奥尔科特\N{\fnArial\fs30}and so he took Sara Alcott as his date instead of me.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:16.10,0:10:19.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,这位莎拉·奥尔科特是你的情敌喽\N{\fnArial\fs30}So, this Sara Alcott was a rival for your husband's affections?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:20.03,0:10:22.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,莎拉和他只过了一夜\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sara had one night with him,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:22.69,0:10:26.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,我和切斯特过了整整37年\N{\fnArial\fs30}whereas I was with Chester for 37 years.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:26.24,0:10:27.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,当然 这是当然\N{\fnArial\fs30}Of course, right. Sure.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:27.71,0:10:29.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,最后一个问题\N{\fnArial\fs30}Um, just one more question.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:31.61,0:10:34.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,这位奥尔科特女士还在世吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Is… Ms. Alcott still alive?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:34.96,0:10:36.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,据我所知 是的\N{\fnArial\fs30}As far as I know, yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:38.26,0:10:40.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,非常感谢 卢夫人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thank you very much, Mrs. Lew.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:41.43,0:10:42.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,我说这算怎么回事\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let me get this straight.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:42.37,0:10:43.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,这可怜的家伙\N{\fnArial\fs30}This poor guy.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:44.21,0:10:46.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,三十多年前跟别的女孩去毕业舞会\N{\fnArial\fs30}goes to prom with some girl over 30 years ago,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:46.25,0:10:48.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,就为这个而变了肉饼\N{\fnArial\fs30}and because of that, he is now a pancake?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:48.54,0:10:49.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果是鬼魂\N{\fnArial\fs30}I mean, if this is a ghost,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:49.63,0:10:50.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,也许是恶灵附体\N{\fnArial\fs30}maybe it's some sort of possession?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:50.69,0:10:51.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,你说什么呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}What are you talking about?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:51.76,0:10:53.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,你也听到了 奥尔科特还活着\N{\fnArial\fs30}You heard her. Alcott's alive.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:53.04,0:10:54.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,必须跟她谈谈\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, we're definitely gonna want to talk to her.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:55.35,0:10:57.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,嗯 有道理\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, sounds like a plan.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:57.73,0:10:59.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们吃饭了吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Did we eat yet?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:04.90,0:11:06.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,谢谢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thanks.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:07.21,0:11:09.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,再上点儿\N{\fnArial\fs30}Keep'em coming.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:10.63,0:11:13.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,迪恩 透露下内幕\N{\fnArial\fs30}So, Dean, give me the skinny.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:13.07,0:11:15.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,你这一年去了哪\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where were you this past year?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:16.21,0:11:19.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,关于我暑假都干了什么下次再说吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why don't we save what I did on my summer vacation for another time?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:19.33,0:11:20.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,快说嘛\N{\fnArial\fs30}Aw, come on.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:23.67,0:11:24.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:25.14,0:11:26.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,我在炼狱\N{\fnArial\fs30}I was in purgatory.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:28.88,0:11:31.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,真正的炼狱吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Like the purgatory purgatory?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:32.62,0:11:34.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 是迈阿密的那座\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, the one in Miami.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:34.38,0:11:37.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,兄弟 那太该死了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Man, that's balls.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:38.11,0:11:39.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,「该死」不是这么用的\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's not how you say "balls."
Dialogue: 0,0:11:41.45,0:11:42.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,那你是怎么出来的\N{\fnArial\fs30}So how'd you get out?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:48.07,0:11:51.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,怎么到处挂着南方邦联的旗帜\N{\fnArial\fs30}What's up with all the, uh, hillbilly hankies?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:51.14,0:11:53.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,这些人知道南北战争早结束了吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}These people know the Civil War's over, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:53.30,0:11:55.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,南北战争在这里是敏感话题\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's a touchy subject around these parts.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:55.91,0:11:58.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,密苏里州曾经是南北交界处\N{\fnArial\fs30}See, Missouri was a border state.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:59.09,0:12:01.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,一半人支持南方邦联\N{\fnArial\fs30}So, half the men were confederate,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:01.46,0:12:03.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,另一半支持北方联邦\N{\fnArial\fs30}the other half were the union.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:03.39,0:12:04.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,你怎么知道这些\N{\fnArial\fs30}How do you know all this?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:06.06,0:12:07.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,我上过大学\N{\fnArial\fs30}I went to college.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:08.02,0:12:09.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,你上过大学\N{\fnArial\fs30}You went to college?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:09.05,0:12:09.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,是\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:09.77,0:12:11.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,大学 然后是牙科学院\N{\fnArial\fs30}College, and on to dental school.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:11.92,0:12:13.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,你还做过牙医\N{\fnArial\fs30}What, you … you were a dentist?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:13.99,0:12:16.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,对呀 就那么一阵子\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, just for, like, a hot minute.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:16.06,0:12:18.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,你以为我怎么开始猎魔的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where'd you think I got my first case?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:18.94,0:12:21.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,让我猜猜 牙仙\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let me guess … tooth fairy.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:31.41,0:12:32.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,对\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:33.49,0:12:36.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,杀那个畜生时我难受极了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Man, I felt terrible when I ganked that S.O.B.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:37.82,0:12:39.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,你杀了那个牙仙\N{\fnArial\fs30}Uh, you killed the tooth fairy?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:39.79,0:12:40.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,是啊 兄弟\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, man.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:40.68,0:12:44.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,不是我最自豪的事情 但是事实\N{\fnArial\fs30}I mean, not my proudest moment, but it happened.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:50.24,0:12:51.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,真好吃\N{\fnArial\fs30}Man, this is good.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:00.95,0:13:02.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,喂 亲爱的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, hon.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:02.43,0:13:05.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,正要去医院 在这儿买杯咖啡\N{\fnArial\fs30}Uh, just, uh, grabbing some joe on the way to the hospital,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:05.11,0:13:06.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,去给老妈送东西\N{\fnArial\fs30}gonna bring mom her stuff.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:06.46,0:13:07.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,该死\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, crap.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:08.54,0:13:09.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,杰夫也在\N{\fnArial\fs30}Jeff's here.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:12.13,0:13:13.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,别担心 我没事\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't worry, I'll be fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:14.25,0:13:15.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,好的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:16.42,0:13:17.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,爱你\N{\fnArial\fs30}Love you.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:45.74,0:13:47.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,斯科特 你好…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, Scott, how's …
Dialogue: 0,0:13:47.54,0:13:50.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,你父母的事情我都听说了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Uh, look, I heard about what happened with your folks.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:50.20,0:13:52.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,真的非常遗憾\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm really sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:52.14,0:13:53.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果有任何\N{\fnArial\fs30}If there's … there's anything …
Dialogue: 0,0:13:53.53,0:13:54.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,我帮得上忙的地方\N{\fnArial\fs30}I mean, anything … that I can do,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:54.79,0:13:56.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,请尽管说\N{\fnArial\fs30}just … just ask, man. Please.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:56.70,0:13:59.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,那就把钱还我吧 杰夫\N{\fnArial\fs30}How about getting me my money back, Jeff?!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:29.75,0:14:31.54,Title,0,0,0,0,,老妈先来一出《天生杀人狂》\N{\fnArial\fs30}So, first the mom goes "Natural Born Killer, "
Dialogue: 0,0:14:31.55,0:14:32.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,儿子立刻跟上\N{\fnArial\fs30}and now the son?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:33.53,0:14:36.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,难道是有俄狄浦斯情结的鬼魂\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, what do we got … a ghost with an Oedipus Complex?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:37.32,0:14:38.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,我也不懂那是什么意思\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't know what that means.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:39.05,0:14:40.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,瞧瞧这个\N{\fnArial\fs30}Check that out.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:41.16,0:14:42.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,苏塞克斯\N{\fnArial\fs30}"Sussex."
Dialogue: 0,0:14:42.33,0:14:43.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,又是人名吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}What is that, another name?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:43.94,0:14:45.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,不知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't know.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:45.54,0:14:47.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,警察怎么说\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, what'd the cops say?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:47.71,0:14:49.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,不是吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Aw, come on.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:51.15,0:14:52.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,没说什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}Not much.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:52.06,0:14:54.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,斯科特坚称当时无法控制自己\N{\fnArial\fs30}Uh, Scott insisted he wasn't in control of himself.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:54.62,0:14:56.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,他说只记得一阵狂怒\N{\fnArial\fs30}Says all he remembers is a red-hot rage.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:56.73,0:14:59.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,这算怎么回事 家族诅咒吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}So, what is this, some … some kind of family curse?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:59.42,0:15:00.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,那是鲍比的帽子吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Is that Bobby's hat?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:01.23,0:15:02.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,对 当然是\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, yeah. Sure is.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:03.05,0:15:06.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,几年前一起追捕法国狼人\N{\fnArial\fs30}We worked a rugaru case together a few years back.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:06.30,0:15:08.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,他落在我车里的 我留着做个…\N{\fnArial\fs30}He left it in my car, so I kept it as a…
Dialogue: 0,0:15:08.84,0:15:10.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,纪念\N{\fnArial\fs30}memento.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:10.13,0:15:12.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你干什么 - 帽子不是这么戴的\N{\fnArial\fs30}- What are you doing?! - That's not how you wear it.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:13.41,0:15:15.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,先生们 监控录像可以看了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Gentlemen, surveillance is up,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:15.33,0:15:18.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,但是画面有干扰\N{\fnArial\fs30}but something is all screwy with it.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:23.90,0:15:25.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,一定是摄像机坏了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Must be the camera.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:26.29,0:15:28.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,谢谢 副警长\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, thank you, there, deputy.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:30.12,0:15:31.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,注意到他的头了吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You guys see the head?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:31.31,0:15:32.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,从前见过这种情况吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ever seen anything like that before?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:32.81,0:15:34.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,这样的吗 没见过\N{\fnArial\fs30}Like that? No way.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:34.85,0:15:35.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,怎么办\N{\fnArial\fs30}So?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:36.51,0:15:37.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,怎么办\N{\fnArial\fs30}So?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:37.15,0:15:39.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,我想我们得找莎拉·奥尔科特谈谈\N{\fnArial\fs30}So, I'm thinking we need to talk to Sara Alcott.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:39.53,0:15:42.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,我找到她了 她现在叫莎拉·布朗\N{\fnArial\fs30}I found her … although these days, she goes by Sara Brown.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:42.40,0:15:43.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,不如这样吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}How about this?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:43.46,0:15:44.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,我去找她\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll check her out,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:44.10,0:15:46.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们查查苏塞克斯\N{\fnArial\fs30}and you two see what you can find out about Sussex.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:46.08,0:15:47.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,好的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Word.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:47.48,0:15:48.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,好极了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Awesome.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:54.83,0:15:59.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,我知道你大老远跑来不是为了喝茶 探员\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now, I know you didn't come all this way for my sweet tea, agent.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:59.99,0:16:03.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,其实 我是为切斯特·卢的事而来\N{\fnArial\fs30}No. Um, actually, I'm … I'm here about Chester Lew.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:04.06,0:16:05.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,原来如此\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:05.57,0:16:06.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,真让人难过\N{\fnArial\fs30}So sad.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:06.72,0:16:07.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,是啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}It is.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:07.73,0:16:11.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,你真的跟切斯特约过会吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Is it true you and Chester… dated a ways back?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:11.62,0:16:15.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,联调局问这种问题可真是奇怪啊 不是吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, that is an odd question for the FBI, isn't it?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:16.54,0:16:19.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,你不会相信我问过多少奇怪的问题\N{\fnArial\fs30}You wouldn't believe the awkward questions I've had to ask people.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:19.49,0:16:20.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:20.55,0:16:23.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,是的 没错\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well yes. Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:23.50,0:16:26.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,我和老色鬼切斯特一起参加过毕业舞会\N{\fnArial\fs30}Me and that old tomcat, Chester, we went to prom together.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:27.34,0:16:28.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,就是这样\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's about it.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:29.50,0:16:30.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,仅此而已吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}And that's all?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:32.19,0:16:35.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,我算不上是个好女孩\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, I wasn't exactly a good girl,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:35.96,0:16:37.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果你是想问这个\N{\fnArial\fs30}if that's what you mean.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:39.38,0:16:40.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,打那之后\N{\fnArial\fs30}And after that,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:40.06,0:16:42.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,我以为我会和切斯特轰轰烈烈地爱一场\N{\fnArial\fs30}I-I thought that Chester and I were gonna be hot and heavy.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:42.97,0:16:45.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,但是有缘无分\N{\fnArial\fs30}But it just wasn't meant to be.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:45.90,0:16:49.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,一星期后 他就跟玛丽就私奔了\N{\fnArial\fs30}And, uh, a week later, he eloped with Mary.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:49.33,0:16:52.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,那之后你跟他们还说过话吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Did you speak much to Mary or Chester again after that?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:52.86,0:16:56.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,倒是见过面 野餐之类的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, I'd see them about, you know … picnics and such.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:56.13,0:17:00.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,不过 玛丽把他看得很紧\N{\fnArial\fs30}But…Mary kept Chester on a pretty short leash.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:00.71,0:17:04.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,说实话 我是翻篇了 可她却没有\N{\fnArial\fs30}Honestly, I'd moved on, but it seems she never did.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:04.50,0:17:06.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,你说这是为什么呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}And why do you think that is?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:06.77,0:17:09.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,我想在她的心里\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, I guess in her mind,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:09.35,0:17:12.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,我永远提醒着她切斯特曾经的背叛\N{\fnArial\fs30}I was a reminder of Chester's betrayal.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:13.28,0:17:16.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果没有别的事\N{\fnArial\fs30}So, if that's all…
Dialogue: 0,0:17:17.20,0:17:19.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,是的 非常感谢你的帮助\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes, uh, thank you very much for your help.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:43.52,0:17:46.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,我很久没有让自己如此随性了\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's been a long time since I let myself go like that.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:48.02,0:17:49.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,我完全理解\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, I know what you mean.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:50.69,0:17:53.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,你问我是不是失去了谁\N{\fnArial\fs30}You asked me if I lost someone.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:55.10,0:17:56.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,没错\N{\fnArial\fs30}I did.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:57.51,0:17:58.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,我的丈夫\N{\fnArial\fs30}My husband.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:00.26,0:18:02.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,八个月前他在阿富汗牺牲了\N{\fnArial\fs30}He died in Afghanistan eight months ago.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:03.80,0:18:05.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,这一定很…\N{\fnArial\fs30}That must have been, um…
Dialogue: 0,0:18:08.17,0:18:09.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,我无法想象\N{\fnArial\fs30}I can't imagine.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:11.16,0:18:12.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,对\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:14.06,0:18:15.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们本可以长相厮守\N{\fnArial\fs30}We were together forever.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:17.12,0:18:19.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,至少我以为会那样\N{\fnArial\fs30}Or at least it seemed that way.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:21.26,0:18:23.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,然后有一天 唐突然参军了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Then one day, Don just enlists.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:24.51,0:18:25.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,都没问我的意见\N{\fnArial\fs30}Didn't ask me,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:25.81,0:18:28.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,只说他想去做该做的事情\N{\fnArial\fs30}just said something about wanting to do the right thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:30.41,0:18:33.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,然后他就远渡重洋 留我孤身一人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Next thing I know, he's off overseas and I'm all alone.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:36.55,0:18:40.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,我只有他的信和电话\N{\fnArial\fs30}I got a couple letters, some phone calls,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:40.96,0:18:42.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,再就是军队上门通报死讯\N{\fnArial\fs30}and then a knock at the door.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:44.48,0:18:45.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,就这样\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just like that.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:46.97,0:18:48.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,我所到之处\N{\fnArial\fs30}And everywhere I looked,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:48.64,0:18:52.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,都是人们的议论和同情\N{\fnArial\fs30}all I could see was judgment and pity.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:52.92,0:18:56.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,一切一切都让我想起唐\N{\fnArial\fs30}and just this constant reminder of Don everywhere.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:57.84,0:18:59.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,所以我搬到了这里\N{\fnArial\fs30}So I moved here…
Dialogue: 0,0:19:01.72,0:19:04.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,但是我却越来越糟\N{\fnArial\fs30}…and became even more of a hot mess than I already was.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:08.06,0:19:09.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,直到你撞了条狗\N{\fnArial\fs30}And you hit a dog.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:32.71,0:19:34.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,松手 小子\N{\fnArial\fs30}Easy there, flyweight.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:35.04,0:19:36.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,上次你乱喝酒\N{\fnArial\fs30}Last time you drank a beer,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:36.09,0:19:38.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,人都粘在地板上了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I had to pick you up off the floor.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:41.22,0:19:42.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,你真是个白痴\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're such an idjit.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:48.11,0:19:50.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,白痴是生气时用来骂人的话\N{\fnArial\fs30}Idjit's supposed to be used angrily.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:51.64,0:19:52.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,懂吗 我不爱听\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay? Not happy.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:52.95,0:19:55.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,不会用就别说\N{\fnArial\fs30}If you're gonna butcher it, don't say it at all.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:55.63,0:19:57.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Whoa, then. Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:00.08,0:20:01.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,虽然不关我的事\N{\fnArial\fs30}N-none of my business,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:01.28,0:20:04.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,但这是因为你跟萨姆的事吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}but…this have anything to do with you and…Sam?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:04.88,0:20:06.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,你说得对 这不关你的事\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, you had it right. It's none of your business.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:07.24,0:20:08.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:08.05,0:20:09.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,我只是觉得\N{\fnArial\fs30}It just seems that you guys.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:09.10,0:20:11.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们之间的关系有点紧张\N{\fnArial\fs30}are a little tense around each other.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:11.66,0:20:12.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们很好\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:13.45,0:20:14.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,可以继续工作了吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Can we get back to work?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:15.10,0:20:15.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,好的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:15.89,0:20:16.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,好\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:17.27,0:20:17.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:17.90,0:20:20.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,我就想告诉你\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just, uh … just letting you know.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:20.03,0:20:22.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,我可以为你们做任何事\N{\fnArial\fs30}that I'm here for you, for anything.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:24.88,0:20:27.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,我知道有时候 鲍比会…\N{\fnArial\fs30}I know sometimes Bobby, he would …
Dialogue: 0,0:20:27.07,0:20:28.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,你不是鲍比\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're not Bobby!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:29.02,0:20:30.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,懂吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:30.37,0:20:34.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,你永远不会成为鲍比 所以别闹了\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're never gonna be Bobby, so stop!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:41.41,0:20:45.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,鲍比是我们大家的朋友 不仅属于你和萨姆\N{\fnArial\fs30}Bobby belonged to all of us, Dean … not just you and Sam.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:48.61,0:20:50.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,我只是用他教我的东西\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now, I'm just taking what he showed me.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:50.04,0:20:52.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,想要造福他人 仅此而已\N{\fnArial\fs30}and trying do something with it. That's all!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:57.87,0:20:59.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,那你看看能不能在他那本破书里\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why don't you see if you can find something.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:59.03,0:21:00.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,找到什么有用的\N{\fnArial\fs30}in that bourbon-drenched book of his.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:00.87,0:21:02.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们也好早日离开南部\N{\fnArial\fs30}so we can get the hell out of Dixie, all right?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:03.53,0:21:05.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,好 我看着呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah. I'm on it.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:15.42,0:21:17.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,苏塞克斯不是「谁」 而是「什么」\N{\fnArial\fs30}"Sussex" is not a who, it's a what.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:17.75,0:21:20.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,是一家一年前才倒闭的公司\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's a business that went belly-up about a year ago.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:20.04,0:21:20.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,看这里\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look at this.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:20.61,0:21:23.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,那个被斯科特爆头的家伙\N{\fnArial\fs30}So, the guy that Scott brained?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:24.22,0:21:27.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,是他以前的合伙人 把公司搞破产了\N{\fnArial\fs30}His old business partner … ran the company into the ground.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:27.77,0:21:30.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,斯科特和杰夫是有矛盾的\N{\fnArial\fs30}So, Scott had a beef with Jeff.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:30.59,0:21:31.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,看来是这样\N{\fnArial\fs30}Looks like.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:35.34,0:21:36.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,我开扬声器了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, you're on speaker.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:37.09,0:21:38.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,莎拉·奥尔科特没问题\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sara Alcott's clean,
Dialogue: 0,0:21:38.57,0:21:39.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,她只不过是\N{\fnArial\fs30}if you look past the fact that.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:39.48,0:21:42.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,跟切斯特在舞会之夜有一夜情罢了\N{\fnArial\fs30}she and Chester knocked boots on prom night back in the day.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:42.49,0:21:44.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧 那么…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay, so…
Dialogue: 0,0:21:44.58,0:21:46.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,玛丽对莎拉怀恨在心\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mary has a grudge against Sara,
Dialogue: 0,0:21:46.40,0:21:49.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,而斯科特对杰夫怀恨在心\N{\fnArial\fs30}and Scott has a grudge against Jeff.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:49.17,0:21:50.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,这些线索除了让我头疼\N{\fnArial\fs30}Besides the fact this is making my head hurt,
Dialogue: 0,0:21:50.81,0:21:52.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,跟鬼魂能扯上什么关系\N{\fnArial\fs30}how does this add up to a ghost?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:53.24,0:21:54.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,伙计们\N{\fnArial\fs30}Guys!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:54.31,0:21:55.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,鲍比在这儿写了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Bobby has it right here.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:55.75,0:21:58.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,绿色粘液代表厉鬼的存在\N{\fnArial\fs30}Green goo equals a spectre.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:58.19,0:21:59.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,也就是鬼魂吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Which equals ghost, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:59.47,0:22:00.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,对 算是吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mm, yeah, kind of.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:00.85,0:22:02.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,厉鬼是想复仇的鬼魂\N{\fnArial\fs30}A spectre is an avenging ghost.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:02.36,0:22:04.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,它会上身\N{\fnArial\fs30}It, uh … it possesses you.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:04.32,0:22:06.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,发现宿主心中感受到的背叛\N{\fnArial\fs30}and finds out whatever betrayals you're feeling.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:06.21,0:22:08.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,再强迫宿主去报仇\N{\fnArial\fs30}and forces you to act on them.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:08.12,0:22:10.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,鲍比提没提如何猎捕这东西\N{\fnArial\fs30}Bobby say anything in there about how we hunt these things?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:10.41,0:22:13.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,他最后一次遇见厉鬼\N{\fnArial\fs30}Uh, the last spectre he encountered.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:13.55,0:22:17.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,是有人刚刚亵渎了一座附近的坟墓\N{\fnArial\fs30}rose shortly after someone desecrated a nearby grave.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:21.88,0:22:22.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,而这里…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Which…
Dialogue: 0,0:22:23.37,0:22:28.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,三天前刚有个墓地遭人亵渎\N{\fnArial\fs30}Uh, there was a grave desecrated locally three days ago.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:28.01,0:22:29.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,这里提到\N{\fnArial\fs30}It says here…
Dialogue: 0,0:22:31.89,0:22:33.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,这下麻烦了\N{\fnArial\fs30}This could get awkward.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:33.97,0:22:35.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,怎么了\N{\fnArial\fs30}What?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:39.41,0:22:40.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,无名士兵墓地\N{\fnArial\fs30}The unknown soldier?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:41.50,0:22:42.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,你开玩笑吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're kidding me, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:42.41,0:22:43.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,玛丽·卢杀死她丈夫的前一天\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mary Lew steamrolled her husband.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:43.74,0:22:45.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,恰好这地方被人搞了破坏\N{\fnArial\fs30}the day after this place was vandalized.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:45.68,0:22:46.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,你想呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do the math.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:46.50,0:22:48.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,无名士兵不是都埋在阿林顿（国家公墓）吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}But I thought the unknown soldier was buried in Arlington.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:48.50,0:22:51.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,没错 但这是南方邦联无名士兵的陵墓\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yep, but this is the confederate tomb of the unknown soldier.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:51.10,0:22:52.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,是这样的\N{\fnArial\fs30}See, the idea was,
Dialogue: 0,0:22:52.40,0:22:55.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们找了一个尸体无法辨认的无名士兵\N{\fnArial\fs30}they took a faceless, nameless soldier they couldn't identien,
Dialogue: 0,0:22:55.14,0:22:58.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,埋葬于此 纪念所有丧生的士兵\N{\fnArial\fs30}and they buried him here to commemorate all the soldiers who died.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:58.27,0:22:59.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,大学里学来的吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Did you learn that in college?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:59.66,0:23:01.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 是内战重演活动\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nope … civil war re-enactments.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:01.27,0:23:03.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,年年都有 每年一次\N{\fnArial\fs30}Once a year, every year.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:04.74,0:23:05.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,别嫉妒我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't hate.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:07.67,0:23:09.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,守卫怎么办\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay, uh, what about the guard?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:09.64,0:23:11.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,他就是摆个样子 傍晚就走了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Uh, he's ceremonial. Gone by dusk.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:11.98,0:23:13.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 那我们今晚动手吗 - 对\N{\fnArial\fs30}- So, then we do this tonight? - Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:13.77,0:23:16.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,在南方佬的地盘上烧掉他们士兵的骨头\N{\fnArial\fs30}Burn a confederate soldier's bones in a town full of rednecks?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:16.37,0:23:17.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,真棒\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sure.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:41.22,0:23:42.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,我没看出有人搞破坏的痕迹\N{\fnArial\fs30}Place doesn't look disturbed to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:43.20,0:23:44.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,警局的报告怎么说来着\N{\fnArial\fs30}What's the police report say?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:44.66,0:23:46.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们说只是几个小孩来这里捣蛋\N{\fnArial\fs30}Uh, they think it was just some kids messing around.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:46.44,0:23:49.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们找到了几个啤酒罐还有涂鸦\N{\fnArial\fs30}They, uh … they found some beer cans, some graffiti.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:49.18,0:23:51.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,棺盖当时是开着的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, and the casket was open when they got here,
Dialogue: 0,0:23:51.18,0:23:52.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们给关回去了\N{\fnArial\fs30}but they closed that back up.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:52.84,0:23:55.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,但里面的东西还是跑了出来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, but not before casper had a chance to make a run for it.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:55.25,0:23:57.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,那如果他们不碰这些东西\N{\fnArial\fs30}So, what? If they never touched this,
Dialogue: 0,0:23:57.16,0:23:58.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,事情就不会发生吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}none of this would be happening?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:58.60,0:24:00.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,从鲍比的书上来看是这样\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, according to Bobby.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:01.88,0:24:05.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧 我们开始干活\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right, well, let's get this party started.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:06.70,0:24:08.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,萨姆 过来搭把手\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sammy, you want to give me a hand?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:13.16,0:24:13.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,使劲\N{\fnArial\fs30}And go.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:23.01,0:24:25.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,看看这些小宝贝\N{\fnArial\fs30}Whoa. Check out this hardware.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:25.91,0:24:27.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们知道这些多值钱吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do you guys know how much this is worth?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:27.91,0:24:30.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,是啊 打开了为什么不顺手捞一笔\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, but why open it up if you're not gonna take anything?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:31.10,0:24:32.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,不知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't know.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:32.84,0:24:35.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,或许警察出现把他们吓跑了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Maybe the cops showed up and they had to split fast.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:36.62,0:24:38.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,你确定这对厉鬼也会有用吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You sure this will work, even on a spectre?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:38.36,0:24:39.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,它也是鬼魂 不是吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's a ghost, isn't it?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:39.67,0:24:42.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,烧掉骨头 鬼魂就死了\N{\fnArial\fs30}You burn its bones, the ghost disappears.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:47.82,0:24:49.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,等等\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right. All right. All right. All right.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:49.37,0:24:51.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,我觉得我们该说点什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}Uh, I kind of feel like we should say something, all right?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:51.98,0:24:54.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,你不觉得吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't you? Just…A little…
Dialogue: 0,0:24:58.58,0:24:59.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sure.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:01.15,0:25:02.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,北方赢了\N{\fnArial\fs30}We won.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:10.86,0:25:12.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,替我把这个写好 道格\N{\fnArial\fs30}Write that up for me, would you, Doug?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:20.32,0:25:22.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,救命 拜托\N{\fnArial\fs30}Help! Please!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:26.39,0:25:27.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,你没事吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey. You okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:27.69,0:25:32.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,我需要 哮喘 吸入器\N{\fnArial\fs30}Need my…asthma…inhaler.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:33.10,0:25:35.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,在证物袋里 拜托\N{\fnArial\fs30}From evidence. Please.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:01.95,0:26:04.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,你怎么不自己写报告呢 警长\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why don't you write your own reports, Sheriff?!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:05.69,0:26:06.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,不\N{\fnArial\fs30}No!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:10.43,0:26:13.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,好了 都好了 走吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Right, we're set, let's go.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:17.89,0:26:20.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,赌十块钱 道格副警长对上司有意见\N{\fnArial\fs30}10 bones says deputy Doug had an axe to grind with his boss.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:20.76,0:26:22.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,你怎么知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}How can you be so sure?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:23.25,0:26:24.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,怎么回事啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ah, what the hell?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:25.03,0:26:26.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,也许我们烧错人了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Maybe we torched the wrong redneck.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:26.73,0:26:27.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,也许没错\N{\fnArial\fs30}Or maybe not.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:28.20,0:26:30.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,只是罪魁祸首已经不在墓里了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Maybe an object was removed from the grave,
Dialogue: 0,0:26:30.27,0:26:32.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,厉鬼就附在某个物件上\N{\fnArial\fs30}something the spectre's attaching itself to.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:32.61,0:26:33.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,就像鲍比的酒壶吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Like Bobby's flask?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:33.84,0:26:35.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,说不通啊 伙计们\N{\fnArial\fs30}Um, I don't know, guys.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:35.45,0:26:37.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们都看到了 那些孩子什么都没拿\N{\fnArial\fs30}You saw what I saw. Those kids didn't take anything.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:37.94,0:26:38.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,也许拿了呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Or they did.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:39.44,0:26:40.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,厉鬼就被带出来了\N{\fnArial\fs30}And this spectre hitched a ride with it.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:41.11,0:26:42.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,拿到物件的人就会被附体\N{\fnArial\fs30}And whoever has the object gets possessed.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:42.98,0:26:45.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,那么现在谁拿到了物件 更重要的是\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay. So, who's got the object, and, more importantly,
Dialogue: 0,0:26:46.22,0:26:47.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,那人跟谁有仇\N{\fnArial\fs30}who do they got a grudge against?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:48.90,0:26:50.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,你得集中精神 副警长\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right. We need you to focus, Deputy.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:50.87,0:26:52.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,你的话可以救命\N{\fnArial\fs30}Other lives depend on it.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:53.77,0:26:55.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,告诉我 你射杀了警长之后发生了什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}Tell me what happened after you shot the Sheriff.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:57.08,0:26:58.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,我倒在地上\N{\fnArial\fs30}I was on the ground.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:59.78,0:27:02.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,可能是卡尔把我放倒的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I think Karl tackled me,
Dialogue: 0,0:27:02.02,0:27:03.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,我问他发生了什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}and I asked him what happened.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:04.09,0:27:04.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,然后呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}And?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:05.72,0:27:06.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,他没有回答我\N{\fnArial\fs30}He didn't answer me.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:08.42,0:27:09.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,拿起我的枪就走了\N{\fnArial\fs30}He just took my gun and walked away.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:11.23,0:27:12.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,他说了要去哪吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Did he say where he was going?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:13.33,0:27:17.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,我想 我肯定也伤到他了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I guess… I must have hurt him, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:17.54,0:27:18.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,他说他要去医院\N{\fnArial\fs30}He said he was going to the hospital.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:22.01,0:27:23.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,你俩尽量去查那个无名战士\N{\fnArial\fs30}You two find out what you can about the unknown soldier.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:23.94,0:27:24.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,我去医院\N{\fnArial\fs30}I got the hospital.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:41.03,0:27:42.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,萨姆\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, uh, Sam.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:42.82,0:27:43.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,你要是想找人聊天\N{\fnArial\fs30}If you ever need to talk,
Dialogue: 0,0:27:43.86,0:27:45.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,请记住 我随时奉陪\N{\fnArial\fs30}I just want to let you know that I'm here.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:45.20,0:27:49.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,谈什么都行 生活 迪恩和你\N{\fnArial\fs30}About anything … you know, life, uh, Dean, you.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:49.43,0:27:50.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,我没事 多谢\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm okay. Thanks.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:50.55,0:27:52.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,你和迪恩好像都各说各话\N{\fnArial\fs30}I mean, it just seems like you and Dean are talking.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:52.82,0:27:54.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,没人愿意听对方说\N{\fnArial\fs30}but nobody's listening to each other.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:54.56,0:27:57.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,我有个表亲 他现在不在了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I had this cousin once … well, he's gone now …
Dialogue: 0,0:27:57.62,0:27:59.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,他叫弗兰克\N{\fnArial\fs30}but his name was Frank.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:59.26,0:28:00.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,弗兰克和我曾经共建…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Frank and I used to build…
Dialogue: 0,0:28:08.79,0:28:10.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,你走的时候记得锁门\N{\fnArial\fs30}Uh, just lock up when you leave.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:10.03,0:28:10.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,我迟到了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm late.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:11.26,0:28:12.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,等等 什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wait, what?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:17.36,0:28:19.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,我只是觉得我俩最好别产生什么误会\N{\fnArial\fs30}I just think it's better if neither of us get the wrong idea here.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:21.62,0:28:22.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,好啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}O-okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:22.26,0:28:24.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,我昨晚说了很多话\N{\fnArial\fs30}And I know I said a lot of things last night,
Dialogue: 0,0:28:24.29,0:28:26.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,我知道没办法叫你忘记\N{\fnArial\fs30}and I know I can't ask you to forget them.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:26.73,0:28:29.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,但是 忘了吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}But just…do.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:30.58,0:28:31.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,为什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:31.43,0:28:32.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,因为我不需要你的同情\N{\fnArial\fs30}Because I don't need your pity.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:33.23,0:28:35.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不需要你也对我流露其他人的那种…\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't need you looking at me the way they all …
Dialogue: 0,0:28:36.00,0:28:36.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,就那种眼神\N{\fnArial\fs30}like that.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:37.75,0:28:41.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,你觉得我是同情你吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wait, um you think this is pity?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:42.74,0:28:45.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,艾米利亚 我很高兴你告诉我唐的事\N{\fnArial\fs30}Amelia, I'm glad you told me about Don.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:45.21,0:28:46.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,这让我能理解你\N{\fnArial\fs30}It helps me understand.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:46.27,0:28:48.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,理解我的生活有多糟吗 你以为我不知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}How messed up I am? You think I don't know that?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:49.02,0:28:50.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,你用不着同情我 萨姆\N{\fnArial\fs30}You don't have to feel sorry for me, Sam.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:50.50,0:28:51.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不是那个意思\N{\fnArial\fs30}I didn't mean it like that.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:51.73,0:28:54.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,行了 我快迟到了 那么…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, well, like I said, I'm late. So…
Dialogue: 0,0:29:06.87,0:29:08.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,喂 你来不来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, you comin'?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:21.62,0:29:25.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们知道称他为「无名」战士是有原因的吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}You do know there is a good reason he's called the unknown soldier, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:26.42,0:29:28.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,对 我们想查查这么些年来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Right. Uh, we were just hoping maybe a theory or two.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:28.67,0:29:30.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,会不会有什么说法\N{\fnArial\fs30}had been a floated around over the years …
Dialogue: 0,0:29:30.61,0:29:31.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,当地的传闻\N{\fnArial\fs30}Something local, maybe?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:32.63,0:29:33.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,确实有\N{\fnArial\fs30}There is one.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:39.57,0:29:40.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,裁判\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, Ump.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:40.70,0:29:43.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,记得我吗 你判我盗二垒\N{\fnArial\fs30}You remember me? I stole second!
Dialogue: 0,0:29:43.67,0:29:45.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,卡尔 你这是做什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}Karl? What the hell are you doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:45.87,0:29:46.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,你为什么要…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why are you doing …
Dialogue: 0,0:29:46.51,0:29:49.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,为什么要用你的脑干做芥末酱吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why am I gonna make mustard from your brain stem?!
Dialogue: 0,0:29:49.14,0:29:50.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't know.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:50.68,0:29:52.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,为什么罚我出局 裁判\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why did you call me out, Ump?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:53.28,0:29:54.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,对不起\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:54.58,0:29:55.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,求你了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Please.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:56.51,0:29:57.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,看来是没子弹了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Looks like you're shooting blanks.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:59.97,0:30:02.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,好痒啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, that tickled.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:09.14,0:30:10.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,联邦军的柯林斯下士\N{\fnArial\fs30}Corporal Collins of the union.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:10.81,0:30:14.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,射杀了他加入了邦联的兄弟万斯\N{\fnArial\fs30}shot and killed his brother, Vance, who fought for the confederacy.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:14.44,0:30:15.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,本地的小伙子\N{\fnArial\fs30}Local boys.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:16.61,0:30:19.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,就是说两兄弟在内战时是敌对双方\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wait, so two brothers fought on opposite sides of the Civil War?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:19.64,0:30:24.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,据说万斯死前起誓要找兄弟报仇\N{\fnArial\fs30}Legend has it that Vance swore vengeance on his brother with his dying breath.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:25.47,0:30:27.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,多年后 无疑是因良心不安\N{\fnArial\fs30}Years later … consumed by guilt, no doubt …
Dialogue: 0,0:30:27.82,0:30:29.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,下士从他当年埋兄的\N{\fnArial\fs30}the Corporal dug his brother up.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:29.60,0:30:31.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,战场上把尸体挖了出来\N{\fnArial\fs30}where he'd buried him on the battlefield.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:31.01,0:30:31.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,带回了家\N{\fnArial\fs30}and brought him home.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:31.79,0:30:34.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,你是说这个万斯就是无名战士\N{\fnArial\fs30}Are you suggesting this Vance guy is the unknown soldier?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:35.03,0:30:36.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,有这种说法\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's one theory, anyway.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:37.71,0:30:38.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}What's that?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:40.27,0:30:41.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,卡尔 听着\N{\fnArial\fs30}Karl, listen,
Dialogue: 0,0:30:41.36,0:30:43.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,我知道是厉鬼让你发火\N{\fnArial\fs30}I know the spectre's turning the temperature up in there.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:43.71,0:30:45.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,告诉我通灵物件是什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}So just tell me what the object is,
Dialogue: 0,0:30:45.67,0:30:47.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们把这个捣蛋鬼送回去\N{\fnArial\fs30}and we'll send this joker home.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:47.52,0:30:48.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,我可不这样想\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't think so.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:49.07,0:30:51.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,托你的福 事情还没完呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}There's unfinished business, thanks to you.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:54.68,0:30:57.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,厉鬼喜欢你\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, the spectre likes you.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:57.72,0:30:58.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,是吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, yeah?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:58.76,0:30:59.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,不如你让他出来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why don't you tell him to come on out here?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:59.90,0:31:01.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们做对儿情侣镯\N{\fnArial\fs30}We'll make promise bracelets.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:05.58,0:31:08.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,大多数士兵都是穷苦农民\N{\fnArial\fs30}Most of the soldiers were poor farmers,
Dialogue: 0,0:31:08.05,0:31:11.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,家人会用绳子穿一分钱给他们\N{\fnArial\fs30}so the families would give them a penny on a string.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:12.04,0:31:14.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,算是护身符 而且万一迷路了\N{\fnArial\fs30}It was for good luck, and in case they ever got lost,
Dialogue: 0,0:31:14.78,0:31:17.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,还有一分钱买吃的喝的\N{\fnArial\fs30}they always had a penny for food or drink.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:19.48,0:31:20.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,一分钱\N{\fnArial\fs30}A penny.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:23.69,0:31:26.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,拿去 试试吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Here. Have a taste.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:30.22,0:31:32.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,是我 留言吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's me. Do what you gotta.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:32.23,0:31:32.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,迪恩\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dean, hey.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:32.91,0:31:35.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,墓地的地上有根绳子\N{\fnArial\fs30}There was a string on the floor of the tomb.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:35.23,0:31:36.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,原本穿着一枚硬币\N{\fnArial\fs30}It used to hold an old penny.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:36.96,0:31:38.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,那就是通灵物件\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's the object.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:38.25,0:31:39.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们这就过来\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're coming right now.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:42.70,0:31:44.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,迪恩 怎么回事\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dean? What the hell, man?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:44.24,0:31:47.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们去了医院 你不接电话\N{\fnArial\fs30}We went to the hospital. You're not answering your phone.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:53.85,0:31:56.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,我在炼狱的时候你本该去找我\N{\fnArial\fs30}You should have looked for me when I was in purgatory.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:05.88,0:32:08.79,Note,0,0,0,0,,（三天前）
Dialogue: 0,0:33:31.02,0:33:32.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,清醒点 迪恩\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on, Dean.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:32.44,0:33:33.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,我知道这不是你\N{\fnArial\fs30}I know it's not you in there pulling the strings.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:33.99,0:33:35.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,闭嘴\N{\fnArial\fs30}Shut up!
Dialogue: 0,0:33:36.52,0:33:37.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,别动\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't!
Dialogue: 0,0:33:40.41,0:33:42.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,你根本就不想要这种生活\N{\fnArial\fs30}You never even wanted this life.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:43.34,0:33:45.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,你总是怪我又拉你下水\N{\fnArial\fs30}Always blamed me for pulling you back into it.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:45.97,0:33:47.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 不是这样 - 真的吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}- That's not true. - Really?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:48.06,0:33:49.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,自从你跟我上了路\N{\fnArial\fs30}'cause everything you've ever done.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:49.04,0:33:52.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,你做的每件事都是欺骗我\N{\fnArial\fs30}since you climbed into my ride has been to deceive me.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:52.69,0:33:53.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,你想要我说什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}What do you want me to say?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:54.82,0:33:56.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,说我有错吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}That I've made mistakes?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:56.31,0:33:58.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,我是有错 迪恩\N{\fnArial\fs30}I've made mistakes, Dean.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:59.21,0:34:00.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,他已经不是迪恩了 萨姆\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's not Dean, Sam.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:00.26,0:34:01.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,闭嘴\N{\fnArial\fs30}Shut up!
Dialogue: 0,0:34:03.56,0:34:04.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,有错\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mistakes?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:06.73,0:34:09.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,那我们就来细数一下小萨姆的伟大功绩\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, let's go through some of Sammy's greatest hits.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:10.89,0:34:13.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,饮恶魔血\N{\fnArial\fs30}Drinking demon blood, check.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:13.77,0:34:15.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,与露比合谋\N{\fnArial\fs30}Being in cahoots with Ruby.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:16.17,0:34:18.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,瞒着我你没了灵魂的事\N{\fnArial\fs30}Not telling me that you lost your soul.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:18.92,0:34:22.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,还跟随萨穆埃尔一整年\N{\fnArial\fs30}Or how about running around with Samuel for a whole year,
Dialogue: 0,0:34:22.44,0:34:23.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,就让我以为你死了\N{\fnArial\fs30}letting me think that you were dead.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:23.61,0:34:26.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,而你却在为所欲为\N{\fnArial\fs30}while you're doing all kinds of crazy.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:26.01,0:34:28.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,这些不叫有错 萨姆\N{\fnArial\fs30}Those aren't mistakes, Sam.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:28.13,0:34:29.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,而是选择\N{\fnArial\fs30}Those are choices!
Dialogue: 0,0:34:31.26,0:34:33.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,行 你说得对\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right. You said it.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:33.68,0:34:35.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们俩都有点轻率了\N{\fnArial\fs30}We've both played a little fast and loose.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:35.19,0:34:39.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,对 我也许会撒谎 但绝不曾背叛你\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, I might have lied, but I never once betrayed you.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:41.02,0:34:43.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,绝不曾不管你的死活\N{\fnArial\fs30}I never once left you to die.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:44.29,0:34:46.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,你为了什么 一个姑娘\N{\fnArial\fs30}And for what, a girl?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:47.92,0:34:50.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,你为了个姑娘扔下我不管\N{\fnArial\fs30}You left me to die for a girl?!
Dialogue: 0,0:35:05.66,0:35:06.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,盖思 不要\N{\fnArial\fs30}Garth, don't.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:06.96,0:35:09.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,别担心 他不会杀了我的\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, he won't kill me.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:10.10,0:35:11.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,他怨念的不是我\N{\fnArial\fs30}His beef isn't with me.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:12.77,0:35:14.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,你不会朝我开枪的对吗 迪恩\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're not gonna shoot me, are you, Dean?
Dialogue: 0,0:35:14.74,0:35:15.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,走开\N{\fnArial\fs30}Move.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:15.82,0:35:17.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,别这样 迪恩\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on, Dean.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:17.58,0:35:20.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,你不会想杀了你弟弟的\N{\fnArial\fs30}You do not want to kill your brother.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:20.09,0:35:22.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,你这辈子都在保护他\N{\fnArial\fs30}You … you've been protecting him your whole life.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:22.04,0:35:23.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在也一样\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't stop now.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:23.24,0:35:25.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,他任由我在炼狱里自生自灭\N{\fnArial\fs30}He left me to rot in purgatory!
Dialogue: 0,0:35:25.57,0:35:27.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧 也许是的 我不清楚\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right. All right. Maybe he did. I don't know.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:27.39,0:35:29.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不知道内情 但他肯定自有原因\N{\fnArial\fs30}I wasn't there. But I'm sure he had his reasons.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:29.99,0:35:32.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,就像你留着本尼也自有原因\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just like you had your reasons for Benny.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:33.78,0:35:34.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,谁\N{\fnArial\fs30}Who?
Dialogue: 0,0:35:34.37,0:35:35.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,过去的一年里\N{\fnArial\fs30}Benny has been more of a brother to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:35.89,0:35:37.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,本尼对我的兄弟义气你永远都比不上\N{\fnArial\fs30}this past year than you've ever been!
Dialogue: 0,0:35:39.25,0:35:40.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,没错\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's right.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:40.69,0:35:42.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,小卡让我失望\N{\fnArial\fs30}Cass let me down.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:42.30,0:35:43.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,你让我失望\N{\fnArial\fs30}You let me down.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:43.25,0:35:45.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,唯一从没让我失望的就是本尼\N{\fnArial\fs30}The only person that hasn't let me down is Benny.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:47.24,0:35:48.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,我知道你很生气\N{\fnArial\fs30}I know you're angry.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:49.19,0:35:50.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,不过老兄 你得与这东西抗争\N{\fnArial\fs30}But, man, you got to fight this thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:50.38,0:35:52.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,别这么做\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do not do this!
Dialogue: 0,0:35:52.49,0:35:53.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,放下恩怨吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just let it go.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:57.11,0:35:58.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,拜托了 迪恩\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on, Dean.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:00.63,0:36:01.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,再见了 萨姆\N{\fnArial\fs30}Goodbye, Sam.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:08.65,0:36:10.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,天呐\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ow! God!
Dialogue: 0,0:36:17.04,0:36:18.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,盖思 别捡\N{\fnArial\fs30}Garth, don't!
Dialogue: 0,0:36:20.43,0:36:21.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,没事\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's cool.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:22.69,0:36:24.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,没关系 我没事\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's all good. I'm cool.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:39.24,0:36:41.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,我费了九牛二虎之力才熔了那枚硬币\N{\fnArial\fs30}It took me forever to melt that penny,
Dialogue: 0,0:36:41.06,0:36:42.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,不过总算搞定了\N{\fnArial\fs30}but it's finally gone.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:42.29,0:36:44.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,你怎么不像其他人一样被硬币控制了呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}How come that penny didn't jack you like everyone else?
Dialogue: 0,0:36:45.04,0:36:47.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,我理解它怎么不能影响拿走它的孩子\N{\fnArial\fs30}I mean, I can understand why it didn't affect the kid who took it.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:47.40,0:36:48.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,他年轻 单纯\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's young and innocent.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:48.70,0:36:51.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,可是 无论谁这一生中总有\N{\fnArial\fs30}But, uh, everyone at some point in their life.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:51.43,0:36:52.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,觉得自己被耍了的时候\N{\fnArial\fs30}feels like they've been screwed.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:52.99,0:36:53.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,我没有 兄弟\N{\fnArial\fs30}Not me, man.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:53.98,0:36:56.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,我靠练瑜伽把那些都放下了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I let all that stuff go with the help of my yogi,
Dialogue: 0,0:36:56.49,0:36:58.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,还有世嘉创世游戏\N{\fnArial\fs30}my Sega Genesis.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:58.49,0:36:59.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,你也该这样\N{\fnArial\fs30}And you should, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:00.30,0:37:02.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,历史是无从改变的 朋友\N{\fnArial\fs30}You can't change the past, amigo.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:02.75,0:37:06.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,对了 我有话想跟你说\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now, there's something I want to say to you.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:06.78,0:37:08.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,别再那么白痴了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Stop being a idjit!
Dialogue: 0,0:37:10.41,0:37:13.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,鲍比死了 你和萨姆是彼此的唯一\N{\fnArial\fs30}With Bobby dead, you and Sam are all each other has.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:14.15,0:37:16.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,这没那么糟 兄弟\N{\fnArial\fs30}And that's not so bad, man.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:17.98,0:37:19.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,好了 你知道该怎么做了吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now, you know what's coming next, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:37:21.68,0:37:22.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,来吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:23.43,0:37:24.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,快点\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:24.30,0:37:25.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:46.50,0:37:48.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,好好干 盖思\N{\fnArial\fs30}Keep on truckin', Garth.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:49.22,0:37:50.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,谢了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thanks.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:51.29,0:37:52.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,该走了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, got to go.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:56.07,0:37:57.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,喂 拉马尔 什么情况\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yo, Lamar. What do we got?
Dialogue: 0,0:37:58.36,0:37:59.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,雪怪温迪戈\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wendigo?
Dialogue: 0,0:37:59.64,0:38:00.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,你有信号枪吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You got a flare gun?
Dialogue: 0,0:38:02.60,0:38:03.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,没有\N{\fnArial\fs30}No?
Dialogue: 0,0:38:03.99,0:38:05.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,那喷火器呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}What about a flame thrower?
Dialogue: 0,0:38:07.90,0:38:09.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,那最好备几双跑鞋了 伙计\N{\fnArial\fs30}Then you'd better get some sneakers, buddy,
Dialogue: 0,0:38:09.83,0:38:11.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,因为你得跑路了\N{\fnArial\fs30}'cause you're gonna have to run.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:11.76,0:38:12.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,好\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:21.43,0:38:22.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,该死\N{\fnArial\fs30}Balls!
Dialogue: 0,0:38:49.55,0:38:51.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,萨姆 我做不到\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sam, I can't.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:51.62,0:38:53.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不是同情你 好吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't pity you. Okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:38:54.54,0:38:55.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,不是\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:57.39,0:39:00.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,你和我 我们有很多毛病\N{\fnArial\fs30}You and I … we're a lot of things,
Dialogue: 0,0:39:01.17,0:39:02.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,但我们不需要同情\N{\fnArial\fs30}but we're not to be pitied.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:05.36,0:39:08.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,几个月前我失去了哥哥 迪恩\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look, I lost my brother, Dean, a few months ago.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:09.98,0:39:12.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,我的世界好像崩塌了\N{\fnArial\fs30}It felt like my world imploded.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:12.47,0:39:14.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,那一切向我袭来 于是\N{\fnArial\fs30}and came raining down on me, and…
Dialogue: 0,0:39:16.18,0:39:17.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,我逃了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I ran.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:17.67,0:39:18.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,和你一样\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just like you.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:21.05,0:39:22.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,你这番话是想鼓励我吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Is that supposed to be a pep talk?
Dialogue: 0,0:39:24.71,0:39:26.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,是的 大概吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, uh, sort of.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:27.02,0:39:28.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,因为\N{\fnArial\fs30}Because…
Dialogue: 0,0:39:28.27,0:39:29.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,我开始同情你了\N{\fnArial\fs30}see, now I pity you.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:33.58,0:39:36.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,其实 我倒不是这个意思\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, look, I mean, that wasn't really my point.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:37.10,0:39:39.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,可我就是这个感觉 所以…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, well, bell's rung on that one, so…
Dialogue: 0,0:39:43.07,0:39:44.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,那么\N{\fnArial\fs30}So, uh…
Dialogue: 0,0:39:46.44,0:39:47.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,那么我们现在干什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}So what now?
Dialogue: 0,0:39:48.52,0:39:49.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't know.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:49.93,0:39:51.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,你想好好聊聊吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You want to talk about it?
Dialogue: 0,0:39:54.14,0:39:55.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,昨晚的事\N{\fnArial\fs30}Last night?
Dialogue: 0,0:39:55.45,0:39:57.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,不是 是迪恩 你个变态\N{\fnArial\fs30}No. Dean, you pervert.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:01.47,0:40:03.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,好 好的 我很乐意\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah. Yeah, I'd like that.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:04.89,0:40:07.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,你想说说唐吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do you want to talk about Don?
Dialogue: 0,0:40:11.00,0:40:13.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,我乐意听你说\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, I'd like that, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:19.06,0:40:20.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,小萨姆\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sammy!
Dialogue: 0,0:40:27.57,0:40:32.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,我就说一声 那姑娘 她叫艾米利亚\N{\fnArial\fs30}For the record, the girl … her name's Amelia.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:33.08,0:40:34.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,艾米利亚·理查森\N{\fnArial\fs30}Amelia Richardson.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:34.21,0:40:37.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们在德克萨斯州的科米特有个住处\N{\fnArial\fs30}She and I had a place together in Kermit, Texas.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:37.49,0:40:38.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,老实说我都不太记得我说什么了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look, man, I don't even remember what I said,
Dialogue: 0,0:40:38.88,0:40:39.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,不过\N{\fnArial\fs30}but, uh …
Dialogue: 0,0:40:39.59,0:40:40.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,不过什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}But what?
Dialogue: 0,0:40:40.72,0:40:42.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,不过那不是真心话吗 别骗人了\N{\fnArial\fs30}But you didn't mean it? Oh, please.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:43.00,0:40:45.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们都清楚你不用那枚硬币就能说出那番话\N{\fnArial\fs30}You and I both know you didn't need that penny to say those things.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:45.12,0:40:45.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,别这样 萨姆\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on, Sam.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:45.70,0:40:47.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,说什么就认了吧 迪恩\N{\fnArial\fs30}Own up to your crap, Dean.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:47.83,0:40:50.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,你一回来我就说了自己都去过哪\N{\fnArial\fs30}I told you from the jump where I was coming from,
Dialogue: 0,0:40:50.33,0:40:51.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,我为什么没去找你\N{\fnArial\fs30}why I didn't look for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:51.26,0:40:52.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,你呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}But you?
Dialogue: 0,0:40:52.68,0:40:54.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,你有秘密\N{\fnArial\fs30}You had secrets.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:54.12,0:40:55.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,你有本尼\N{\fnArial\fs30}You had Benny.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:55.46,0:40:56.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,你一回来就高高在上\N{\fnArial\fs30}And you got on your high and mighty,
Dialogue: 0,0:40:56.75,0:40:59.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,对我咄咄逼人\N{\fnArial\fs30}and you've been kicking me ever since you got back.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:59.97,0:41:01.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,这都过去了\N{\fnArial\fs30}But that's over.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:01.97,0:41:03.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,都忘了吧 否则我就走人\N{\fnArial\fs30}So move on, or I will.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:06.61,0:41:07.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,好\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:08.14,0:41:09.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,我知道了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I hear you.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:10.18,0:41:11.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,很好\N{\fnArial\fs30}Good.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:15.22,0:41:16.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,我跟你说 还有\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know what? Hear this, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:17.62,0:41:18.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,我或许就会是\N{\fnArial\fs30}I just might be that hunter.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:18.77,0:41:21.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,那个碰到本尼还结果了他的猎魔人\N{\fnArial\fs30}that runs into Benny one day and ices him.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:23.85,0:41:26.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,我想这事是车到山前必有路 对吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}I guess we'll cross that bridge when we come to it, won't we?
Dialogue: 0,0:41:28.79,0:41:29.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,对\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:30.49,0:41:32.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,你总是这句话\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah. You keep saying that.
